<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuadorian fishermen who survived US drone attacks on their boats are suing the Trump administration for unlawful attacks, kidnapping and torture, while President Noboa continues to deny any US military base in the country. Prison gangs are expanding drug trafficking, illustrated by a man sentenced for fentanyl and heroin offenses, and the country is described as turning into a narco state. Violence against civilians persists, with a journalist murdered outside his home, two local election candidates shot dead in El Oro, and a priest killed when a crucifix fell during mass. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPV191Y0VWSFdIZmhxZVkwM3d2MFdOajZES1FMUEtBUkdrVGRTRW9GY2puOGRMVVJzWHNjVkNPd19sSTRTdXNLVDM2SHR5OWhydkNJZ1Y1TjJEWklQZXo1MnJoWDhVUzd2NHp4QUtKcE4yVVBRWHAteERuenFDOUhFanRaS2w4SXJGS3h2bG42eWdMUDQ2SUlMcjdQa2lrYjdPZXJVSDhkbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg Law News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQZFFLRXdkUk9WMWJDc3RYTVhnYlZ2bEhVTGRqazJ6OEE5YVFFemtWa2dVdDU2ZG9ycGJkRkVzV1FrSDVaLVlJN1JSNmZpU1E0R29rc0lEbU1mRnVCMzN2aFE2RGNhUFU2cGM2Sm5Rc1liQ0pkNjVhQ1BoeEVBdUxRdzZpU005TDJpRS1GdUVlX2Z3bmZldG1WS2txOGhUMmFHeU5WRVhWclk5RnNyLTFJZUp2M0tOb1d2cTJYd3h6YmU3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPUkF6QTdlZlB3NDJJbVZ4VnVLSUdhcFF4WjRSOFpoWkhMcnc3RVZtZFE1OGQ5bWZQdHlxWlR0RFgxS1RobTY0RHhkUEpySm1NSVBQbnRnVDgzX2tYbkNpTU5YQXl4UmF0X2o4R3NqMjhsYWhHTk9oVTVtZ2oxbnV6UlFOcmpWdFkyU2cxX3huU21IUkhzLXRkRmpCMEtCYTJ3NWRN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPQVM2SEVWUXlCWC1sdTJqWlJ5Tm8wTUVmYW12U